    {
      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "Sample Request",
      "Anchor": "sample-request",
      "SectionPath": [
        "Retrieve Organization Page Edge Analytics Data",
        "Sample Request"
      ],
      "Text": "How to determine which organizational pages you can query:\nTo find the organizational pages you can query {{resource, plural}} for, please use OrganizationAuthorization\u2019s BATCH_FIND by AuthorizationAction and AuthenticatedMember\nwith an authorization action of OrganizationAnalyticsAuthorizationActionType.VISITOR_ANALYTICS_READ. For any organization returned, convert it to an organizationalPage using the OrganizationalPage pageEntity finder",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "FINDER Dimension",
      "Anchor": "finder-dimension",
      "SectionPath": [
        "Retrieve Organization Page Edge Analytics Data",
        "FINDER Dimension"
      ],
      "Text": "Note",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "FINDER Dimension",
      "Anchor": "finder-dimension",
      "SectionPath": [
        "Retrieve Organization Page Edge Analytics Data",
        "FINDER Dimension"
      ],
      "Text": "We are taking the following measures to protect member privacy and limit backtracking of analytics data.",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "FINDER Dimension",
      "Anchor": "finder-dimension",
      "SectionPath": [
        "Retrieve Organization Page Edge Analytics Data",
        "FINDER Dimension"
      ],
      "Text": "Analytics values that are lower than a specific threshold determined by the server will be returned as 0 instead.\nIf the same exact request is sent twice, slightly different results might be returned due to the randomization factor added by the server to the actual analytics value.\nWe enforce API rate limits in order to protect member identity. Once the quota is fully used, results with analytics value equal to 0 will be returned with metadata indicating the quota refresh time.\nIf the actual analytics value is very close to the server set threshold, the added randomization factor might put it below the threshold for some requests hence results with analytics value equal to 0 will be returned.",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "FINDER Dimension",
      "Anchor": "finder-dimension",
      "SectionPath": [
        "Retrieve Organization Page Edge Analytics Data",
        "FINDER Dimension"
      ],
      "Text": "http\n\n\ncurl",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "code",
      "Section": "FINDER Dimension",
      "Anchor": "finder-dimension",
      "SectionPath": [
        "Retrieve Organization Page Edge Analytics Data",
